<mj-text>
  For example, with a gross salary of 2000&nbsp;€, 94&nbsp;€ a month goes into your II&nbsp;pillar from your net salary and a tax win of 106&nbsp;€ is added on top.
  The last day to file the application is *|secondPillarRejoinDeadline|*. After rejoining you can no longer leave the II&nbsp;pillar.
</mj-text>
<mj-text><strong>Get the tax win again</strong></mj-text>
